         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="47.25">
         <CEL MERGEACROSS="4" STYLEID="s50">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">* Air-entrained counterparts for these cements listed are also allowed in masonry grout. However, use of air-entrainment is not recommended when the grout will be used to bond reinforcement to the masonry units.</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="24.00">
